nths of the relevant financial year.6.During the quarter ended 30th June, 2026, the Parent Company has allotted 8,250 equity shares of Rs. 2 each pursuant to exercise of options under the approved Rossari Employee Stock Option Plan - 2019.7.Previous year / period figures have been regrouped to make them comparable with the current year /  period figures, wherever applicable, which are not material. &lt;br /&gt; 
